&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offre d&#39;Emploi : Lead AI Governance (Center of Expertise Data &amp;amp; AI Governance - Central)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe &lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Governance&lt;/strong&gt; recherche un·e &lt;strong&gt;Lead AI Governance (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt; en CDI, basé·e à Lille ou Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous croyons au pouvoir du sport pour unir et inspirer. Notre mission : rendre le sport accessible au plus grand nombre, partout dans le monde. Pour y parvenir, la data et l’intelligence artificielle sont au cœur de notre stratégie, guidant chaque décision, de la conception du produit à l&#39;expérience client et sportive. Notre défi ? Déployer une IA éthique, sûre, performante et auditable à l&#39;échelle mondiale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu seras rattaché au Head of Data &amp;amp; AI Governance et tu rejoindras le Data &amp;amp; AI Governance Center of Expertise (CoE) en tant que référent·e technique et méthodologique (&lt;strong&gt;rôle d&#39;expert / Staff track&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;sans management hiérarchique direct&lt;/strong&gt;). Ta mission sera de bâtir et porter notre framework de gouvernance de l&#39;IA, de sécuriser notre passage à l&#39;échelle (Agentique, GenAI &amp;amp; ML classique) et de guider l&#39;ensemble des équipes vers une IA de confiance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TON CONTEXTE DE JEU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une organisation internationale fédérée :&lt;/strong&gt; ~70 pays et 5 Business Units majeures avec une forte autonomie locale, nécessitant un cadre clair, agile et une visibilité centrale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un produit interne dédié :&lt;/strong&gt; La plateforme &lt;strong&gt;GovAI&lt;/strong&gt;, en cours d&#39;industrialisation (registre unique des cas d’usage, évaluation algorithmique et gestion continue des risques).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un collectif pluridisciplinaire soudé :&lt;/strong&gt; Animation d&#39;un comité opérationnel hebdomadaire réunissant le Legal, la Compliance, les Risques, la Sécurité et les Achats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que lead d&#39;expertise et chef d&#39;orchestre fonctionnel, tu fais le pont entre les exigences réglementaires, la technique et le business. Tu es là pour éclairer les choix stratégiques et fédérer la communauté autour de standards responsables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tes missions s&#39;articulent autour de 4 grands axes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pilotage Stratégique &amp;amp; Framework :&lt;/strong&gt; Définir notre doctrine d&#39;AI Governance (alignée sur l&#39;AI Act / RGPD) et animer le Comité Opérationnel (Legal, Risques, Sécurité). Tu portes la roadmap globale et pilotes son succès par des KPIs concrets (ROI, délai de qualification).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plateforme &quot;GovAI&quot; &amp;amp; Governance as Code :&lt;/strong&gt; Travailler avec l&#39;équipe Produit/Build du CoE pour industrialiser notre plateforme interne. L&#39;objectif : implémenter une logique de Governance as Code en automatisant l&#39;intégration des garde-fous (biais, traçabilité, drift) directement dans les pipelines (MLOps/LLMOps) pour réduire le &lt;em&gt;Time to Market&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion des Risques &amp;amp; Actifs IA :&lt;/strong&gt; Standardiser la classification des risques (systèmes critiques vs non-critiques) et piloter l&#39;inventaire unifié des modèles (GenAI &amp;amp; ML). Tu garantis la conformité des données (entraînement/inférence) sur tout le cycle de vie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acculturation &amp;amp; Réseau (AI Literacy) :&lt;/strong&gt; Fédérer un réseau mondial (~70 pays, 5 BU) de Data Scientists, PM et leaders Tu agis en partenaire de confiance et &lt;em&gt;Business Enabler&lt;/em&gt; pour démocratiser l&#39;IA de confiance sans freiner l&#39;innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Senior en Gouvernance IA &amp;amp; Data :&lt;/strong&gt; Une solide expérience sur les problématiques d&#39;IA Responsable, de gestion des risques algorithmiques et de réglementation (notamment l&#39;AI Act européen, RGPD, standards ISO/IEC 42001 ou NIST AI RMF).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership d&#39;influence &amp;amp; Posture d&#39;expert :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellente capacité à fédérer des collectifs pluridisciplinaires (tech, business, legal), à vulgariser des concepts complexes et à obtenir l’adhésion sans autorité hiérarchique dans un environnement international et distribué.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Technique Data &amp;amp; Machine Learning :&lt;/strong&gt; Compréhension approfondie du cycle de vie des modèles ML/DL, des architectures Cloud, des spécificités de la GenAI (RAG, fine-tuning, guardrails) et des mécanismes de données associés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit &quot;Business Enabler&quot; :&lt;/strong&gt; Pragmatisme et sens du résultat ; tu conçois la gouvernance comme un accélérateur d&#39;innovation sécurisé plutôt que comme un centre de contrôle bloquant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE &amp;amp; ÉCOSYSTÈME&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ton quotidien, tu interagiras avec un écosystème technologique moderne :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gouvernance, Métadonnées &amp;amp; Catalogage :&lt;/strong&gt; Unity Catalog, Collibra, outils d&#39;inventaire IA / Model Registry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, AI &amp;amp; MLOps :&lt;/strong&gt; Databricks (Mosaic AI, MLflow), Python, dbt, Airflow, frameworks de test &amp;amp; monitoring IA (évaluation LLM, détection de biais/drift)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diplôme&lt;/strong&gt; (Licence, Master ou École d&#39;Ingénieur) en Informatique, Data, Systèmes d&#39;Information ou domaine connexe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10 ans d&#39;expérience au minimum&lt;/strong&gt; en Data Governance, Data Stewardship, Data Quality ou gestion de programme data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expériences probante sdans l&#39;animation de communautés et la conduite du changement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anglais courant (niveau B2/C1 minimum)&lt;/strong&gt; dans un environnement international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build the engineering foundations that enable AI agents to work with enterprise tools and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work focuses on the &lt;strong&gt;Agent Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, which coordinates agent execution and provides controlled access to tools and execution environments. Our platform directly powers the Celonis Context Model, meaning we work as a product team in close collaboration with product managers and other roles rather than an infrastructure team. Expect to work close to the end-user experience, shipping tangible product improvements in rapid iteration loops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will design, build, and operate backend services that serve the platform with the AI capabilities they need to perform useful work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own complex features from understanding the problem and defining the technical approach through implementation, deployment, and ongoing improvement. The work combines Python development, asynchronous execution, data processing, and practical application of large language models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help the team make thoughtful architectural decisions, balance delivery with maintainability, and turn evolving requirements into dependable software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build agent execution capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop services for agent sessions, execution state, streaming responses, tool integrations, and controlled execution environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for reliable execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Handle concurrency, cancellation, retries, partial failures, and recovery so that long-running operations behave predictably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect customer data and actions:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement authorization, tenant isolation, input validation, and appropriate controls around agent access to tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own complex features through delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Clarify requirements with stakeholders, document design choices, break work into manageable increments, and follow through to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and improve quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop automated tests and evaluations, investigate failures, and improve latency, resource usage, and operational visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen the engineering foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; Refactor complex code where needed, improve development and deployment tooling, and contribute reusable APIs and libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help the team succeed:&lt;/strong&gt; Review code, share knowledge, support less experienced engineers, and work with product and engineering partners to define success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial professional experience building and operating backend software with Python, typically 5+ years, with demonstrated ownership of complex features or services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in technical architecture, high-level software design, and scalable system patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience deploying agentic frameworks, machine learning models, or supporting backend ML infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing production APIs using FastAPI or a comparable framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying and troubleshooting services in a cloud environment, using containers, CI/CD, logs, metrics, and tracing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work through ambiguous requirements, explain technical tradeoffs, and balance customer needs with long-term system health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication in English and a collaborative approach to working with technical and non-technical colleagues (German is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in building dependable AI applications and the ability to learn new tools and concepts as the field evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience That Would Be a Plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building applications with LLMs, tool calling, agent orchestration, or the Model Context Protocol (MCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluating agent behavior using representative datasets and regression checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on multi-tenant SaaS systems, authorization boundaries, sandboxed execution, or defenses against prompt injection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with technologies such as Pydantic AI, SQLAlchemy, PostgreSQL, message queues, object storage, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need experience with every technology listed. We value strong engineering judgment, ownership, and the ability to learn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive, you’ll help us grow with some of the largest manufacturers in Southern Germany. You’ll own a focused portfolio of enterprise accounts across Bavaria and Baden-Württemberg, a mix of established Everpure customers and new logos, and lead the full sales cycle from first conversation to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manufacturers are investing in smart factories, AI, connecting factory systems with IT, supply chain resilience and protection against ransomware. You’ll get to know those challenges inside each customer’s business and show how Everpure’s data platform helps solve them. You’ll work closely with partners and internal teams, build early success by growing existing customers, then expand into whitespace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a focused portfolio of enterprise manufacturing accounts and run each one like a business, with clear multi-year account plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow existing Everpure customers by uncovering new projects, teams and use cases, and win new logos in whitespace accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full sales cycle and direct pursuit teams of sales engineers, partner managers and specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships up to the C-suite, framing conversations around business outcomes, ROI and risk rather than products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in manufacturing: learn how your customers make money, what their leadership worries about, and speak their language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with channel partners and system integrators to widen your reach and co-sell into your accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong pipeline, forecast accurately and consistently exceed your targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of exceeding quota selling to large enterprise accounts, ideally in enterprise software, SaaS, cybersecurity or infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling business value: you diagnose customer problems and turn them into outcomes the business cares about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with manufacturing, automotive or industrial customers is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong account planning, prospecting and stakeholder skills, from IT leaders to the board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience co-selling with channel partners in a direct and indirect sales model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in data, cloud and AI. A storage background isn’t required, but you’ll need the curiosity to learn the technology and position it credibly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An owner’s mindset: you’re coachable, seek out feedback and get things done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English, and willingness to travel to customers across Southern Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
